# Base-image OS packages in gcr.io/distroless/java21-debian12:nonroot.
#
# Distroless images have no package manager, so these Debian packages cannot be upgraded in this
# Dockerfile; they clear when Google rebuilds the base image with the patched packages (tracked by
# Dependabot's docker updates, which bump the pinned base). None of these are in the application's
# own jars — the Java dependencies scan clean — and none of these native libraries (expat XML
# parsing, brotli, Little CMS colour management) is loaded by this headless HTTP service.
#
# Reviewed 2026-11-21. Remove entries as the base image picks up the fixes.

# libexpat1 — XML parser (C). Not used by this service.
